'\n        WHEN 7 THEN 'Saturday'\n    END\nORDER BY total_transactions DESC\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726170828_ad5e5ef6-a253-4671-8cae-bf817bb04898\nINFO  : Total jobs = 3\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 3\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"day_name\ttotal_transactions\ttotal_quantity\ttotal_revenue\taverage_transaction_value\nSunday\t2106\t9784\t89770.68\t42.63\nSaturday\t2101\t9801\t90570.71\t43.11\nWednesday\t1765\t8315\t76317.20\t43.24\nMonday\t1718\t7851\t71171.00\t41.43\nFriday\t1716\t7896\t72616.86\t42.32\nThursday\t1695\t7793\t71469.30\t42.16\nTuesday\t1624\t7496\t67815.20\t41.76\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785085511339_1516074645","id":"paragraph_1785085511339_1516074645","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:05:11+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:08:28+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:09:26+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n### Day-of-Week Interpretation\n\n**Sunday** recorded the highest transaction activity, with **2106** transactions.\n\nThe retailer generated approximately **$89,770.68** on this day, while the average transaction value was approximately **$42.63**.\n\nThis result suggests that customer demand is stronger on **Sunday**. Management should consider assigning additional employees, maintaining sufficient inventory, and increasing checkout capacity on this day.\n\nLower-activity days may provide opportunities for inventory replenishment, employee training, and targeted promotions designed to increase customer traffic.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:11:03+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Day-of-Week Interpretation</h3>\n<p><strong>Sunday</strong> recorded the highest transaction activity, with <strong>2106</strong> transactions.</p>\n<p>The retailer generated approximately <strong>$89,770.68</strong> on this day, while the average transaction value was approximately <strong>$42.63</strong>.</p>\n<p>This result suggests that customer demand is stronger on <strong>Sunday</strong>. Management should consider assigning additional employees, maintaining sufficient inventory, and increasing checkout capacity on this day.</p>\n<p>Lower-activity days may provide opportunities for inventory replenishment, employee training, and targeted promotions designed to increase customer traffic.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785085708939_1297760643","id":"paragraph_1785085708939_1297760643","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:08:28+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:11:03+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:11:03+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n## 5. Category Contribution Analysis\n\n### Business Question\n\nHow much does each product category contribute to the retailer's total revenue?\n\n### Analysis Method\n\nThe analysis groups retail sales events by product category and calculates:\n\n- Number of sales events\n- Total quantity sold\n- Total revenue\n- Average revenue per sales event\n- Percentage contribution to overall revenue\n- Revenue rank among all categories\n\nThe revenue contribution percentage helps identify which categories have the greatest influence on overall retail performance.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:16:47+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>5. Category Contribution Analysis</h2>\n<h3>Business Question</h3>\n<p>How much does each product category contribute to the retailer&rsquo;s total revenue?</p>\n<h3>Analysis Method</h3>\n<p>The analysis groups retail sales events by product category and calculates:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Number of sales events</li>\n<li>Total quantity sold</li>\n<li>Total revenue</li>\n<li>Average revenue per sales event</li>\n<li>Percentage contribution to overall revenue</li>\n<li>Revenue rank among all categories</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The revenue contribution percentage helps identify which categories have the greatest influence on overall retail performance.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785085863310_1161805973","id":"paragraph_1785085863310_1161805973","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:11:03+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:16:47+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:16:47+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nWITH category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_event_value\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    sales_events,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_event_value,\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue * 100.0 / SUM(total_revenue) OVER (),\n        2\n    ) AS revenue_contribution_percent\nFROM category_performance\nORDER BY total_revenue DESC;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:26:17+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{"1":{"graph":{"mode":"pieChart","height":704.2708358764648,"optionOpen":true,"setting":{"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false}},"keys":[{"name":"category","index":0,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[],"values":[{"name":"revenue_contribution_percent","index":5,"aggr":"sum"}]}}},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726171709_fe7c166a-f610-4df1-b845-3677dec3a934): \n\nWITH category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_event_value\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    sales_events,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_event_value,\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue * 100.0 / SUM(total_revenue) OVER (),\n        2\n    ) AS revenue_contribution_percent\nFROM category_performance\nORDER BY total_revenue DESC\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: quantity, final_price, category\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:category, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:sales_events, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_quantity, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_revenue, type:decimal(20,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:average_event_value, type:decimal(11,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:revenue_contribution_percent, type:decimal(27,2), comment:null)], properties:null)\nINFO  : Completed compiling command(queryId=root_20260726171709_fe7c166a-f610-4df1-b845-3677dec3a934); Time taken: 0.187 seconds\nINFO  : Concurrency mode is disabled, not creating a lock manager\nINFO  : Executing command(queryId=root_20260726171709_fe7c166a-f610-4df1-b845-3677dec3a934): \n\nWITH category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_event_value\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    sales_events,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_event_value,\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue * 100.0 / SUM(total_revenue) OVER (),\n        2\n    ) AS revenue_contribution_percent\nFROM category_performance\nORDER BY total_revenue DESC\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726171709_fe7c166a-f610-4df1-b845-3677dec3a934\nINFO  : Total jobs = 3\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 3\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"category\tsales_events\ttotal_quantity\ttotal_revenue\taverage_event_value\trevenue_contribution_percent\nGrocery\t11388\t17653\t171287.76\t15.04\t31.74\nProduce\t5678\t8704\t73399.93\t12.93\t13.60\nDairy\t5748\t8902\t70165.09\t12.21\t13.00\nHousehold\t3110\t4771\t61643.25\t19.82\t11.42\nFrozen\t3065\t4721\t60305.89\t19.68\t11.17\nBakery\t3091\t4770\t41660.92\t13.48\t7.72\nMeat\t3053\t4710\t32212.84\t10.55\t5.97\nPersonal Care\t3010\t4705\t29055.27\t9.65\t5.38\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785086207914_1300022786","id":"paragraph_1785086207914_1300022786","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:16:47+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:17:09+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:18:03+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n### Category Contribution Interpretation\n\nThe **Grocery** category made the largest contribution to overall revenue.\n\nIt generated approximately **$171,287.76**, representing **31.74%** of the retailer's total revenue.\n\nThis result shows that the category is a major driver of retail performance. Management should maintain sufficient inventory and closely monitor product availability within this category.\n\nHowever, relying too heavily on a small number of categories may increase business risk. The retailer should continue supporting high-performing categories while also identifying opportunities to improve lower-contributing categories.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:20:35+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Category Contribution Interpretation</h3>\n<p>The <strong>Grocery</strong> category made the largest contribution to overall revenue.</p>\n<p>It generated approximately <strong>$171,287.76</strong>, representing <strong>31.74%</strong> of the retailer&rsquo;s total revenue.</p>\n<p>This result shows that the category is a major driver of retail performance. Management should maintain sufficient inventory and closely monitor product availability within this category.</p>\n<p>However, relying too heavily on a small number of categories may increase business risk. The retailer should continue supporting high-performing categories while also identifying opportunities to improve lower-contributing categories.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785086229232_2057515392","id":"paragraph_1785086229232_2057515392","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:17:09+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:20:35+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:20:35+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nWITH category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_event_value\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    sales_events,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_event_value,\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue * 100.0 / SUM(total_revenue) OVER (),\n        2\n    ) AS revenue_contribution_percent,\n    RANK() OVER (\n        ORDER BY total_revenue DESC\n    ) AS revenue_rank\nFROM category_performance\nORDER BY revenue_rank;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:20:50+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726172050_adc3ca91-5432-4c60-9484-8b93f0e93ae2): \n\nWITH category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_event_value\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    sales_events,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_event_value,\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue * 100.0 / SUM(total_revenue) OVER (),\n        2\n    ) AS revenue_contribution_percent,\n    RANK() OVER (\n        ORDER BY total_revenue DESC\n    ) AS revenue_rank\nFROM category_performance\nORDER BY revenue_rank\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: quantity, final_price, category\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:category, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:sales_events, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_quantity, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_revenue, type:decimal(20,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:average_event_value, type:decimal(11,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:revenue_contribution_percent, type:decimal(27,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:revenue_rank, type:int, comment:null)], properties:null)\nINFO  : Completed compiling command(queryId=root_20260726172050_adc3ca91-5432-4c60-9484-8b93f0e93ae2); Time taken: 0.147 seconds\nINFO  : Concurrency mode is disabled, not creating a lock manager\nINFO  : Executing command(queryId=root_20260726172050_adc3ca91-5432-4c60-9484-8b93f0e93ae2): \n\nWITH category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_event_value\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    sales_events,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_event_value,\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue * 100.0 / SUM(total_revenue) OVER (),\n        2\n    ) AS revenue_contribution_percent,\n    RANK() OVER (\n        ORDER BY total_revenue DESC\n    ) AS revenue_rank\nFROM category_performance\nORDER BY revenue_rank\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726172050_adc3ca91-5432-4c60-9484-8b93f0e93ae2\nINFO  : Total jobs = 4\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 4\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"category\tsales_events\ttotal_quantity\ttotal_revenue\taverage_event_value\trevenue_contribution_percent\trevenue_rank\nGrocery\t11388\t17653\t171287.76\t15.04\t31.74\t1\nProduce\t5678\t8704\t73399.93\t12.93\t13.60\t2\nDairy\t5748\t8902\t70165.09\t12.21\t13.00\t3\nHousehold\t3110\t4771\t61643.25\t19.82\t11.42\t4\nFrozen\t3065\t4721\t60305.89\t19.68\t11.17\t5\nBakery\t3091\t4770\t41660.92\t13.48\t7.72\t6\nMeat\t3053\t4710\t32212.84\t10.55\t5.97\t7\nPersonal Care\t3010\t4705\t29055.27\t9.65\t5.38\t8\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785086435288_317416208","id":"paragraph_1785086435288_317416208","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:20:35+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:20:50+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:22:00+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n### Category Revenue Ranking\n\nThe query uses the Hive `RANK()` window function to rank product categories by total revenue.\n\nA revenue rank of **1** identifies the category that generated the highest total revenue.\n\nCombining revenue rank with contribution percentage makes it easier to identify the categories that have the greatest impact on overall business performance.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:22:38+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Category Revenue Ranking</h3>\n<p>The query uses the Hive <code>RANK()</code> window function to rank product categories by total revenue.</p>\n<p>A revenue rank of <strong>1</strong> identifies the category that generated the highest total revenue.</p>\n<p>Combining revenue rank with contribution percentage makes it easier to identify the categories that have the greatest impact on overall business performance.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785086450170_1516954523","id":"paragraph_1785086450170_1516954523","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:20:50+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:22:38+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:22:38+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nWITH category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        SUM(final_price) AS total_revenue\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n),\n\ncategory_contribution AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        total_revenue,\n        total_revenue * 100.0 /\n            SUM(total_revenue) OVER ()\n            AS contribution_percent\n    FROM category_performance\n)\n\nSELECT\n    ROUND(SUM(contribution_percent), 2)\n        AS total_contribution_percent\nFROM category_contribution;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:22:54+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726172255_e5ab162b-f793-419a-96e9-c559c0009191): \n\nWITH category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        SUM(final_price) AS total_revenue\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n),\n\ncategory_contribution AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        total_revenue,\n        total_revenue * 100.0 /\n            SUM(total_revenue) OVER ()\n            AS contribution_percent\n    FROM category_performance\n)\n\nSELECT\n    ROUND(SUM(contribution_percent), 2)\n        AS total_contribution_percent\nFROM category_contribution\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: final_price, category\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:total_contribution_percent, type:decimal(27,2), comment:null)], properties:null)\nINFO  : Completed compiling command(queryId=root_20260726172255_e5ab162b-f793-419a-96e9-c559c0009191); Time taken: 0.112 seconds\nINFO  : Concurrency mode is disabled, not creating a lock manager\nINFO  : Executing command(queryId=root_20260726172255_e5ab162b-f793-419a-96e9-c559c0009191): \n\nWITH category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        SUM(final_price) AS total_revenue\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n),\n\ncategory_contribution AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        total_revenue,\n        total_revenue * 100.0 /\n            SUM(total_revenue) OVER ()\n            AS contribution_percent\n    FROM category_performance\n)\n\nSELECT\n    ROUND(SUM(contribution_percent), 2)\n        AS total_contribution_percent\nFROM category_contribution\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726172255_e5ab162b-f793-419a-96e9-c559c0009191\nINFO  : Total jobs = 3\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 3\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"total_contribution_percent\n100.00\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785086558382_677684087","id":"paragraph_1785086558382_677684087","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:22:38+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:22:54+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:23:51+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n## 6. Promotion Performance by Category\n\n### Business Question\n\nHow does promotional performance vary across product categories?\n\n### Analysis Method\n\nThis analysis compares promotional and non-promotional sales within each product category.\n\nFor each category and promotion status, the query calculates:\n\n- Number of sales events\n- Total quantity sold\n- Total discount amount\n- Total revenue\n- Average revenue per sales event\n- Promotional revenue contribution within the category\n\nThis analysis helps identify which categories benefit most from promotional activity.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:29:35+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>6. Promotion Performance by Category</h2>\n<h3>Business Question</h3>\n<p>How does promotional performance vary across product categories?</p>\n<h3>Analysis Method</h3>\n<p>This analysis compares promotional and non-promotional sales within each product category.</p>\n<p>For each category and promotion status, the query calculates:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Number of sales events</li>\n<li>Total quantity sold</li>\n<li>Total discount amount</li>\n<li>Total revenue</li>\n<li>Average revenue per sales event</li>\n<li>Promotional revenue contribution within the category</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This analysis helps identify which categories benefit most from promotional activity.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785086574989_1216834503","id":"paragraph_1785086574989_1216834503","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:22:54+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:29:35+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:29:35+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotion_flag,\n    COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n    SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n    ROUND(SUM(discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount,\n    ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue,\n    ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_event_value\nFROM retail_events_analytics\nGROUP BY\n    category,\n    promotion_flag\nORDER BY\n    category,\n    promotion_flag;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:47:51+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{"1":{"graph":{"mode":"multiBarChart","height":300,"optionOpen":true,"setting":{"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false},"lineChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","forceY":false,"lineWithFocus":false,"isDateFormat":false,"dateFormat":""},"stackedAreaChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","style":"stack"},"scatterChart":{}},"keys":[{"name":"category","index":0,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[{"name":"promotion_flag","index":1,"aggr":"sum"}],"values":[{"name":"total_revenue","index":5,"aggr":"sum"}]}}},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726172949_6e3535e5-008f-4906-a296-86ab77635397): \n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotion_flag,\n    COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n    SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n    ROUND(SUM(discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount,\n    ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue,\n    ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_event_value\nFROM retail_events_analytics\nGROUP BY\n    category,\n    promotion_flag\nORDER BY\n    category,\n    promotion_flag\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: quantity, final_price, discount_amount, promotion_flag, category\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:category, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:promotion_flag, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:sales_events, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_quantity, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_discount, type:decimal(20,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_revenue, type:decimal(20,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:average_event_value, type:decimal(11,2), comment:null)], properties:null)\nINFO  : Completed compiling command(queryId=root_20260726172949_6e3535e5-008f-4906-a296-86ab77635397); Time taken: 0.121 seconds\nINFO  : Concurrency mode is disabled, not creating a lock manager\nINFO  : Executing command(queryId=root_20260726172949_6e3535e5-008f-4906-a296-86ab77635397): \n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotion_flag,\n    COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n    SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n    ROUND(SUM(discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount,\n    ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue,\n    ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_event_value\nFROM retail_events_analytics\nGROUP BY\n    category,\n    promotion_flag\nORDER BY\n    category,\n    promotion_flag\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726172949_6e3535e5-008f-4906-a296-86ab77635397\nINFO  : Total jobs = 2\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 2\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"category\tpromotion_flag\tsales_events\ttotal_quantity\ttotal_discount\ttotal_revenue\taverage_event_value\nBakery\tN\t2997\t4617\t0.00\t40280.82\t13.44\nBakery\tY\t94\t153\t243.52\t1380.10\t14.68\nDairy\tN\t5542\t8599\t0.00\t66852.48\t12.06\nDairy\tY\t206\t303\t368.11\t3312.61\t16.08\nFrozen\tN\t2974\t4574\t0.00\t58664.25\t19.73\nFrozen\tY\t91\t147\t547.14\t1641.64\t18.04\nGrocery\tN\t11192\t17367\t0.00\t167325.29\t14.95\nGrocery\tY\t196\t286\t990.58\t3962.47\t20.22\nHousehold\tN\t3014\t4622\t0.00\t60366.80\t20.03\nHousehold\tY\t96\t149\t319.12\t1276.45\t13.30\nMeat\tN\t2938\t4537\t0.00\t31474.28\t10.71\nMeat\tY\t115\t173\t184.66\t738.56\t6.42\nPersonal Care\tN\t2894\t4520\t0.00\t26977.80\t9.32\nPersonal Care\tY\t116\t185\t366.54\t2077.47\t17.91\nProduce\tN\t5486\t8425\t0.00\t70378.84\t12.83\nProduce\tY\t192\t279\t533.12\t3021.09\t15.73\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785086975554_935374291","id":"paragraph_1785086975554_935374291","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:29:35+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:29:49+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:30:28+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n### Promotion Performance Interpretation\n\nPromotional performance varies across product categories.\n\nThe category with the highest promotional revenue was **Grocery**, generating approximately **$3,962.47** from promoted sales events.\n\nGrocery recorded **196 promotional sales events** and sold **286 units** under promotion, with a total discount amount of approximately **$990.58**.\n\nComparing promotional and non-promotional revenue helps determine whether a category depends heavily on discounts or performs strongly at regular prices.\n\nAlthough Grocery generated the highest promotional revenue, promotional sales represented only a small percentage of its total category revenue. This suggests that Grocery performance still depends mainly on regular-priced sales rather than promotions.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:46:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Promotion Performance Interpretation</h3>\n<p>Promotional performance varies across product categories.</p>\n<p>The category with the highest promotional revenue was <strong>Grocery</strong>, generating approximately <strong>$3,962.47</strong> from promoted sales events.</p>\n<p>Grocery recorded <strong>196 promotional sales events</strong> and sold <strong>286 units</strong> under promotion, with a total discount amount of approximately <strong>$990.58</strong>.</p>\n<p>Comparing promotional and non-promotional revenue helps determine whether a category depends heavily on discounts or performs strongly at regular prices.</p>\n<p>Although Grocery generated the highest promotional revenue, promotional sales represented only a small percentage of its total category revenue. This suggests that Grocery performance still depends mainly on regular-priced sales rather than promotions.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785086989202_696944546","id":"paragraph_1785086989202_696944546","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:29:49+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:46:43+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:46:43+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nWITH category_promotion AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        promotion_flag,\n        COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY\n        category,\n        promotion_flag\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotion_flag,\n    sales_events,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_discount,\n    total_revenue,\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue * 100.0 /\n        SUM(total_revenue) OVER (\n            PARTITION BY category\n        ),\n        2\n    ) AS category_revenue_percent\nFROM category_promotion\nORDER BY\n    category,\n    promotion_flag;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:43:10+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{"1":{"graph":{"mode":"table","height":300,"optionOpen":true,"setting":{"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false}},"keys":[{"name":"category","index":0,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[{"name":"promotion_flag","index":1,"aggr":"sum"}],"values":[{"name":"total_revenue","index":5,"aggr":"sum"}]}}},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726173428_96ba7507-d7a7-4fa1-ac1f-33e1db68b6b6): \n\nWITH category_promotion AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        promotion_flag,\n        COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY\n        category,\n        promotion_flag\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotion_flag,\n    sales_events,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_discount,\n    total_revenue,\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue * 100.0 /\n        SUM(total_revenue) OVER (\n            PARTITION BY category\n        ),\n        2\n    ) AS category_revenue_percent\nFROM category_promotion\nORDER BY\n    category,\n    promotion_flag\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: quantity, final_price, discount_amount, promotion_flag, category\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:category, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:promotion_flag, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:sales_events, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_quantity, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_discount, type:decimal(20,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_revenue, type:decimal(20,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:category_revenue_percent, type:decimal(27,2), comment:null)], properties:null)\nINFO  : Completed compiling command(queryId=root_20260726173428_96ba7507-d7a7-4fa1-ac1f-33e1db68b6b6); Time taken: 0.128 seconds\nINFO  : Concurrency mode is disabled, not creating a lock manager\nINFO  : Executing command(queryId=root_20260726173428_96ba7507-d7a7-4fa1-ac1f-33e1db68b6b6): \n\nWITH category_promotion AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        promotion_flag,\n        COUNT(*) AS sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS total_revenue\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY\n        category,\n        promotion_flag\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotion_flag,\n    sales_events,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_discount,\n    total_revenue,\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue * 100.0 /\n        SUM(total_revenue) OVER (\n            PARTITION BY category\n        ),\n        2\n    ) AS category_revenue_percent\nFROM category_promotion\nORDER BY\n    category,\n    promotion_flag\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726173428_96ba7507-d7a7-4fa1-ac1f-33e1db68b6b6\nINFO  : Total jobs = 2\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 2\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"category\tpromotion_flag\tsales_events\ttotal_quantity\ttotal_discount\ttotal_revenue\tcategory_revenue_percent\nBakery\tN\t2997\t4617\t0.00\t40280.82\t96.69\nBakery\tY\t94\t153\t243.52\t1380.10\t3.31\nDairy\tN\t5542\t8599\t0.00\t66852.48\t95.28\nDairy\tY\t206\t303\t368.11\t3312.61\t4.72\nFrozen\tN\t2974\t4574\t0.00\t58664.25\t97.28\nFrozen\tY\t91\t147\t547.14\t1641.64\t2.72\nGrocery\tN\t11192\t17367\t0.00\t167325.29\t97.69\nGrocery\tY\t196\t286\t990.58\t3962.47\t2.31\nHousehold\tN\t3014\t4622\t0.00\t60366.80\t97.93\nHousehold\tY\t96\t149\t319.12\t1276.45\t2.07\nMeat\tN\t2938\t4537\t0.00\t31474.28\t97.71\nMeat\tY\t115\t173\t184.66\t738.56\t2.29\nPersonal Care\tN\t2894\t4520\t0.00\t26977.80\t92.85\nPersonal Care\tY\t116\t185\t366.54\t2077.47\t7.15\nProduce\tN\t5486\t8425\t0.00\t70378.84\t95.88\nProduce\tY\t192\t279\t533.12\t3021.09\t4.12\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785087254801_803807204","id":"paragraph_1785087254801_803807204","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:34:14+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:34:28+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:35:07+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n### Promotion Contribution Within Categories\n\nThe contribution percentage shows how much of each category's revenue comes from promotional and non-promotional sales.\n\nA high promotional revenue percentage indicates that the category depends more strongly on discounted sales.\n\nA low promotional percentage suggests that the category performs mainly through regular-priced sales.\n\nManagement should evaluate promotional contribution together with total discount amount, sales quantity, and average event value before deciding whether to expand or reduce promotions.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:36:20+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Promotion Contribution Within Categories</h3>\n<p>The contribution percentage shows how much of each category&rsquo;s revenue comes from promotional and non-promotional sales.</p>\n<p>A high promotional revenue percentage indicates that the category depends more strongly on discounted sales.</p>\n<p>A low promotional percentage suggests that the category performs mainly through regular-priced sales.</p>\n<p>Management should evaluate promotional contribution together with total discount amount, sales quantity, and average event value before deciding whether to expand or reduce promotions.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785087268361_1652506144","id":"paragraph_1785087268361_1652506144","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:34:28+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:36:20+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:36:20+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nWITH promoted_category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        COUNT(*) AS promotional_sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS promotional_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS promotional_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_promotional_event_value\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    WHERE promotion_flag = 'Y'\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotional_sales_events,\n    promotional_quantity,\n    total_discount,\n    promotional_revenue,\n    average_promotional_event_value,\n    RANK() OVER (\n        ORDER BY promotional_revenue DESC\n    ) AS promotional_revenue_rank\nFROM promoted_category_performance\nORDER BY promotional_revenue_rank;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:49:00+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{"1":{"graph":{"mode":"table","height":300,"optionOpen":false,"setting":{"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false}},"keys":[{"name":"category","index":0,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[],"values":[{"name":"promotional_sales_events","index":1,"aggr":"sum"}]}}},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726173641_05875e08-708f-4868-b151-f98eb91cf12d): \n\nWITH promoted_category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        COUNT(*) AS promotional_sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS promotional_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS promotional_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_promotional_event_value\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    WHERE promotion_flag = 'Y'\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotional_sales_events,\n    promotional_quantity,\n    total_discount,\n    promotional_revenue,\n    average_promotional_event_value,\n    RANK() OVER (\n        ORDER BY promotional_revenue DESC\n    ) AS promotional_revenue_rank\nFROM promoted_category_performance\nORDER BY promotional_revenue_rank\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: quantity, final_price, discount_amount, promotion_flag, category\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:category, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:promotional_sales_events, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:promotional_quantity, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_discount, type:decimal(20,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:promotional_revenue, type:decimal(20,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:average_promotional_event_value, type:decimal(11,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:promotional_revenue_rank, type:int, comment:null)], properties:null)\nINFO  : Completed compiling command(queryId=root_20260726173641_05875e08-708f-4868-b151-f98eb91cf12d); Time taken: 0.17 seconds\nINFO  : Concurrency mode is disabled, not creating a lock manager\nINFO  : Executing command(queryId=root_20260726173641_05875e08-708f-4868-b151-f98eb91cf12d): \n\nWITH promoted_category_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n        COUNT(*) AS promotional_sales_events,\n        SUM(quantity) AS promotional_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount,\n        ROUND(SUM(final_price), 2) AS promotional_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(final_price), 2) AS average_promotional_event_value\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    WHERE promotion_flag = 'Y'\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotional_sales_events,\n    promotional_quantity,\n    total_discount,\n    promotional_revenue,\n    average_promotional_event_value,\n    RANK() OVER (\n        ORDER BY promotional_revenue DESC\n    ) AS promotional_revenue_rank\nFROM promoted_category_performance\nORDER BY promotional_revenue_rank\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726173641_05875e08-708f-4868-b151-f98eb91cf12d\nINFO  : Total jobs = 3\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 3\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"category\tpromotional_sales_events\tpromotional_quantity\ttotal_discount\tpromotional_revenue\taverage_promotional_event_value\tpromotional_revenue_rank\nGrocery\t196\t286\t990.58\t3962.47\t20.22\t1\nDairy\t206\t303\t368.11\t3312.61\t16.08\t2\nProduce\t192\t279\t533.12\t3021.09\t15.73\t3\nPersonal Care\t116\t185\t366.54\t2077.47\t17.91\t4\nFrozen\t91\t147\t547.14\t1641.64\t18.04\t5\nBakery\t94\t153\t243.52\t1380.10\t14.68\t6\nHousehold\t96\t149\t319.12\t1276.45\t13.30\t7\nMeat\t115\t173\t184.66\t738.56\t6.42\t8\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785087380718_1417332397","id":"paragraph_1785087380718_1417332397","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:36:20+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:36:41+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:37:36+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n### Promotional Category Ranking\n\nThe ranking query uses the Hive `RANK()` window function to identify the categories with the highest promotional revenue.\n\nA promotional revenue rank of **1** represents the category that generated the greatest revenue from promoted sales.\n\nThis ranking helps management identify which categories currently receive the strongest financial contribution from promotional activity.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:38:19+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Promotional Category Ranking</h3>\n<p>The ranking query uses the Hive <code>RANK()</code> window function to identify the categories with the highest promotional revenue.</p>\n<p>A promotional revenue rank of <strong>1</strong> represents the category that generated the greatest revenue from promoted sales.</p>\n<p>This ranking helps management identify which categories currently receive the strongest financial contribution from promotional activity.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785087401907_1204967403","id":"paragraph_1785087401907_1204967403","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:36:41+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:38:19+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:38:19+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n### Key Finding\n\nGrocery ranked first in promotional revenue with approximately **$3,962.47**.\n\nHowever, promotional revenue represented only about **2.31%** of Grocery's total category revenue. This indicates that Grocery's overall performance is driven mainly by regular-priced sales rather than promotional activity.\n\nDairy generated the second-highest promotional revenue and showed a higher promotional contribution percentage than Grocery, suggesting that promotions may play a relatively stronger role in Dairy sales.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:48:28+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Key Finding</h3>\n<p>Grocery ranked first in promotional revenue with approximately <strong>$3,962.47</strong>.</p>\n<p>However, promotional revenue represented only about <strong>2.31%</strong> of Grocery&rsquo;s total category revenue. This indicates that Grocery&rsquo;s overall performance is driven mainly by regular-priced sales rather than promotional activity.</p>\n<p>Dairy generated the second-highest promotional revenue and showed a higher promotional contribution percentage than Grocery, suggesting that promotions may play a relatively stronger role in Dairy sales.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785088103185_1658403319","id":"paragraph_1785088103185_1658403319","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:48:23+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:48:28+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:48:28+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nWITH promotion_comparison AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n\n        ROUND(\n            AVG(\n                CASE\n                    WHEN promotion_flag = 'Y'\n                    THEN final_price\n                END\n            ),\n            2\n        ) AS promotional_average_value,\n\n        ROUND(\n            AVG(\n                CASE\n                    WHEN promotion_flag = 'N'\n                    THEN final_price\n                END\n            ),\n            2\n        ) AS non_promotional_average_value,\n\n        SUM(\n            CASE\n                WHEN promotion_flag = 'Y'\n                THEN quantity\n                ELSE 0\n            END\n        ) AS promotional_quantity,\n\n        SUM(\n            CASE\n                WHEN promotion_flag = 'N'\n                THEN quantity\n                ELSE 0\n            END\n        ) AS non_promotional_quantity\n\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotional_average_value,\n    non_promotional_average_value,\n    promotional_quantity,\n    non_promotional_quantity,\n    ROUND(\n        promotional_average_value -\n        non_promotional_average_value,\n        2\n    ) AS average_value_difference\nFROM promotion_comparison\nORDER BY average_value_difference DESC;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:38:31+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726173831_2f968af8-3727-40f1-abe8-1e21af9cc465): \n\nWITH promotion_comparison AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n\n        ROUND(\n            AVG(\n                CASE\n                    WHEN promotion_flag = 'Y'\n                    THEN final_price\n                END\n            ),\n            2\n        ) AS promotional_average_value,\n\n        ROUND(\n            AVG(\n                CASE\n                    WHEN promotion_flag = 'N'\n                    THEN final_price\n                END\n            ),\n            2\n        ) AS non_promotional_average_value,\n\n        SUM(\n            CASE\n                WHEN promotion_flag = 'Y'\n                THEN quantity\n                ELSE 0\n            END\n        ) AS promotional_quantity,\n\n        SUM(\n            CASE\n                WHEN promotion_flag = 'N'\n                THEN quantity\n                ELSE 0\n            END\n        ) AS non_promotional_quantity\n\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotional_average_value,\n    non_promotional_average_value,\n    promotional_quantity,\n    non_promotional_quantity,\n    ROUND(\n        promotional_average_value -\n        non_promotional_average_value,\n        2\n    ) AS average_value_difference\nFROM promotion_comparison\nORDER BY average_value_difference DESC\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: quantity, final_price, promotion_flag, category\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:category, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:promotional_average_value, type:decimal(11,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:non_promotional_average_value, type:decimal(11,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:promotional_quantity, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:non_promotional_quantity, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:average_value_difference, type:decimal(12,2), comment:null)], properties:null)\nINFO  : Completed compiling command(queryId=root_20260726173831_2f968af8-3727-40f1-abe8-1e21af9cc465); Time taken: 0.145 seconds\nINFO  : Concurrency mode is disabled, not creating a lock manager\nINFO  : Executing command(queryId=root_20260726173831_2f968af8-3727-40f1-abe8-1e21af9cc465): \n\nWITH promotion_comparison AS (\n    SELECT\n        category,\n\n        ROUND(\n            AVG(\n                CASE\n                    WHEN promotion_flag = 'Y'\n                    THEN final_price\n                END\n            ),\n            2\n        ) AS promotional_average_value,\n\n        ROUND(\n            AVG(\n                CASE\n                    WHEN promotion_flag = 'N'\n                    THEN final_price\n                END\n            ),\n            2\n        ) AS non_promotional_average_value,\n\n        SUM(\n            CASE\n                WHEN promotion_flag = 'Y'\n                THEN quantity\n                ELSE 0\n            END\n        ) AS promotional_quantity,\n\n        SUM(\n            CASE\n                WHEN promotion_flag = 'N'\n                THEN quantity\n                ELSE 0\n            END\n        ) AS non_promotional_quantity\n\n    FROM retail_events_analytics\n    GROUP BY category\n)\n\nSELECT\n    category,\n    promotional_average_value,\n    non_promotional_average_value,\n    promotional_quantity,\n    non_promotional_quantity,\n    ROUND(\n        promotional_average_value -\n        non_promotional_average_value,\n        2\n    ) AS average_value_difference\nFROM promotion_comparison\nORDER BY average_value_difference DESC\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726173831_2f968af8-3727-40f1-abe8-1e21af9cc465\nINFO  : Total jobs = 2\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 2\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"category\tpromotional_average_value\tnon_promotional_average_value\tpromotional_quantity\tnon_promotional_quantity\taverage_value_difference\nPersonal Care\t17.91\t9.32\t185\t4520\t8.59\nGrocery\t20.22\t14.95\t286\t17367\t5.27\nDairy\t16.08\t12.06\t303\t8599\t4.02\nProduce\t15.73\t12.83\t279\t8425\t2.90\nBakery\t14.68\t13.44\t153\t4617\t1.24\nFrozen\t18.04\t19.73\t147\t4574\t-1.69\nMeat\t6.42\t10.71\t173\t4537\t-4.29\nHousehold\t13.30\t20.03\t149\t4622\t-6.73\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785087499847_473338339","id":"paragraph_1785087499847_473338339","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:38:19+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:38:31+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:39:13+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n## 7. Store Ranking and Performance Deviation\n\n### Business Question\n\nWhich stores perform best, and how far is each store's revenue above or below the overall store average?\n\n### Analysis Method\n\nThe analysis first calculates store-level performance, including:\n\n- Number of transactions\n- Total quantity sold\n- Total revenue\n- Average transaction value\n\nHive window functions are then used to:\n\n- Rank stores by total revenue\n- Calculate the average revenue across all stores\n- Measure each store's revenue deviation from the overall average\n- Calculate the percentage difference from the overall average\n\nThis analysis helps identify high-performing and underperforming store locations.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:54:39+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>7. Store Ranking and Performance Deviation</h2>\n<h3>Business Question</h3>\n<p>Which stores perform best, and how far is each store&rsquo;s revenue above or below the overall store average?</p>\n<h3>Analysis Method</h3>\n<p>The analysis first calculates store-level performance, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Number of transactions</li>\n<li>Total quantity sold</li>\n<li>Total revenue</li>\n<li>Average transaction value</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Hive window functions are then used to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rank stores by total revenue</li>\n<li>Calculate the average revenue across all stores</li>\n<li>Measure each store&rsquo;s revenue deviation from the overall average</li>\n<li>Calculate the percentage difference from the overall average</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This analysis helps identify high-performing and underperforming store locations.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785087511879_560974961","id":"paragraph_1785087511879_560974961","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:38:31+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:54:39+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:54:39+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nWITH store_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,\n        SUM(total_quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(transaction_value), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(transaction_value), 2) AS average_transaction_value\n    FROM transaction_summary\n    GROUP BY\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region\n)\n\nSELECT\n    store_id,\n    store_city,\n    province,\n    store_region,\n    total_transactions,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_transaction_value,\n    RANK() OVER (\n        ORDER BY total_revenue DESC\n    ) AS revenue_rank\nFROM store_performance\nORDER BY revenue_rank;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T18:02:54+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{"1":{"graph":{"mode":"multiBarChart","height":300,"optionOpen":true,"setting":{"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false}},"keys":[{"name":"store_id","index":0,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[],"values":[{"name":"total_revenue","index":6,"aggr":"sum"}]}}},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726175450_267a1b14-857b-4d52-9101-6c93ffa638d8): \n\nWITH store_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,\n        SUM(total_quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(transaction_value), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(transaction_value), 2) AS average_transaction_value\n    FROM transaction_summary\n    GROUP BY\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region\n)\n\nSELECT\n    store_id,\n    store_city,\n    province,\n    store_region,\n    total_transactions,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_transaction_value,\n    RANK() OVER (\n        ORDER BY total_revenue DESC\n    ) AS revenue_rank\nFROM store_performance\nORDER BY revenue_rank\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: transaction_id, store_id, payment_type, store_city, loyalty_flag, quantity, province, final_price, product_id, event_timestamp, store_region\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:store_id, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:store_city, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:province, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:store_region, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_transactions, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_quantity, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_revenue, type:decimal(30,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:average_transaction_value, type:decimal(21,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:revenue_rank, type:int, comment:null)], properties:null)\nINFO  : Completed compiling command(queryId=root_20260726175450_267a1b14-857b-4d52-9101-6c93ffa638d8); Time taken: 0.158 seconds\nINFO  : Concurrency mode is disabled, not creating a lock manager\nINFO  : Executing command(queryId=root_20260726175450_267a1b14-857b-4d52-9101-6c93ffa638d8): \n\nWITH store_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,\n        SUM(total_quantity) AS total_quantity,\n        ROUND(SUM(transaction_value), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(transaction_value), 2) AS average_transaction_value\n    FROM transaction_summary\n    GROUP BY\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region\n)\n\nSELECT\n    store_id,\n    store_city,\n    province,\n    store_region,\n    total_transactions,\n    total_quantity,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_transaction_value,\n    RANK() OVER (\n        ORDER BY total_revenue DESC\n    ) AS revenue_rank\nFROM store_performance\nORDER BY revenue_rank\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726175450_267a1b14-857b-4d52-9101-6c93ffa638d8\nINFO  : Total jobs = 3\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 3\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"store_id\tstore_city\tprovince\tstore_region\ttotal_transactions\ttotal_quantity\ttotal_revenue\taverage_transaction_value\trevenue_rank\nST-CAL-001\tCalgary\tAlberta\tWestern\t1167\t6046\t55573.77\t47.62\t1\nST-TOR-001\tToronto\tOntario\tCentral\t1302\t5894\t54080.88\t41.54\t2\nST-TOR-002\tToronto\tOntario\tCentral\t1151\t5318\t49425.30\t42.94\t3\nST-OTT-001\tOttawa\tOntario\tEastern\t1157\t5334\t48425.04\t41.85\t4\nST-MIS-001\tMississauga\tOntario\tCentral\t1154\t5236\t47075.34\t40.79\t5\nST-EDM-001\tEdmonton\tAlberta\tWestern\t1094\t5056\t46308.45\t42.33\t6\nST-BRA-001\tBrampton\tOntario\tCentral\t1004\t4451\t40625.77\t40.46\t7\nST-SCA-001\tScarborough\tOntario\tCentral\t949\t4425\t40277.22\t42.44\t8\nST-OTT-002\tOttawa\tOntario\tEastern\t940\t4386\t40078.66\t42.64\t9\nST-LON-001\tLondon\tOntario\tCentral\t947\t4289\t40069.41\t42.31\t10\nST-HAM-001\tHamilton\tOntario\tCentral\t939\t4352\t39916.22\t42.51\t11\nST-KIT-001\tKitchener\tOntario\tCentral\t921\t4149\t37874.89\t41.12\t12\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785088479267_1540500887","id":"paragraph_1785088479267_1540500887","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:54:39+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:54:50+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:55:48+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n### Store Revenue Ranking Interpretation\n\nStore **ST-CAL-001**, located in **Calgary**, ranked first in total revenue.\n\nThe store generated approximately **$55,573.77** from **1167** transactions, with an average transaction value of approximately **$47.62**.\n\nThis result identifies the retailer's strongest store based on overall revenue contribution.\n\nManagement should examine this store's product mix, customer demand, staffing practices, and inventory strategy to identify successful practices that may be applied to other locations.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T17:57:36+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Store Revenue Ranking Interpretation</h3>\n<p>Store <strong>ST-CAL-001</strong>, located in <strong>Calgary</strong>, ranked first in total revenue.</p>\n<p>The store generated approximately <strong>$55,573.77</strong> from <strong>1167</strong> transactions, with an average transaction value of approximately <strong>$47.62</strong>.</p>\n<p>This result identifies the retailer&rsquo;s strongest store based on overall revenue contribution.</p>\n<p>Management should examine this store&rsquo;s product mix, customer demand, staffing practices, and inventory strategy to identify successful practices that may be applied to other locations.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785088490232_776472961","id":"paragraph_1785088490232_776472961","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:54:50+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:57:36+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:57:36+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nWITH store_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,\n        ROUND(SUM(transaction_value), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(transaction_value), 2) AS average_transaction_value\n    FROM transaction_summary\n    GROUP BY\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region\n),\n\nstore_comparison AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        total_transactions,\n        total_revenue,\n        average_transaction_value,\n        ROUND(\n            AVG(total_revenue) OVER (),\n            2\n        ) AS overall_average_store_revenue\n    FROM store_performance\n)\n\nSELECT\n    store_id,\n    store_city,\n    province,\n    store_region,\n    total_transactions,\n    total_revenue,\n    overall_average_store_revenue,\n\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue - overall_average_store_revenue,\n        2\n    ) AS revenue_deviation,\n\n    ROUND(\n        (\n            total_revenue - overall_average_store_revenue\n        ) * 100.0 / overall_average_store_revenue,\n        2\n    ) AS deviation_percent,\n\n    CASE\n        WHEN total_revenue > overall_average_store_revenue\n            THEN 'Above Average'\n        WHEN total_revenue < overall_average_store_revenue\n            THEN 'Below Average'\n        ELSE 'Average'\n    END AS performance_status\n\nFROM store_comparison\nORDER BY revenue_deviation DESC;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T18:06:30+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{"1":{"graph":{"mode":"multiBarChart","height":300,"optionOpen":true,"setting":{"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false}},"keys":[{"name":"store_id","index":0,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[],"values":[{"name":"revenue_deviation","index":7,"aggr":"sum"}]}}},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726175757_306a2272-8f74-49f6-8da2-eac5bc50c7cb): \n\nWITH store_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,\n        ROUND(SUM(transaction_value), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(transaction_value), 2) AS average_transaction_value\n    FROM transaction_summary\n    GROUP BY\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region\n),\n\nstore_comparison AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        total_transactions,\n        total_revenue,\n        average_transaction_value,\n        ROUND(\n            AVG(total_revenue) OVER (),\n            2\n        ) AS overall_average_store_revenue\n    FROM store_performance\n)\n\nSELECT\n    store_id,\n    store_city,\n    province,\n    store_region,\n    total_transactions,\n    total_revenue,\n    overall_average_store_revenue,\n\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue - overall_average_store_revenue,\n        2\n    ) AS revenue_deviation,\n\n    ROUND(\n        (\n            total_revenue - overall_average_store_revenue\n        ) * 100.0 / overall_average_store_revenue,\n        2\n    ) AS deviation_percent,\n\n    CASE\n        WHEN total_revenue > overall_average_store_revenue\n            THEN 'Above Average'\n        WHEN total_revenue < overall_average_store_revenue\n            THEN 'Below Average'\n        ELSE 'Average'\n    END AS performance_status\n\nFROM store_comparison\nORDER BY revenue_deviation DESC\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: transaction_id, store_id, payment_type, store_city, loyalty_flag, quantity, province, final_price, product_id, event_timestamp, store_region\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:store_id, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:store_city, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:province, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:store_region, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_transactions, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_revenue, type:decimal(30,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:overall_average_store_revenue, type:decimal(31,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:revenue_deviation, type:decimal(32,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:deviation_percent, type:decimal(35,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:performance_status, type:string, comment:null)], properties:null)\nINFO  : Completed compiling command(queryId=root_20260726175757_306a2272-8f74-49f6-8da2-eac5bc50c7cb); Time taken: 0.158 seconds\nINFO  : Concurrency mode is disabled, not creating a lock manager\nINFO  : Executing command(queryId=root_20260726175757_306a2272-8f74-49f6-8da2-eac5bc50c7cb): \n\nWITH store_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,\n        ROUND(SUM(transaction_value), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(transaction_value), 2) AS average_transaction_value\n    FROM transaction_summary\n    GROUP BY\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region\n),\n\nstore_comparison AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        total_transactions,\n        total_revenue,\n        average_transaction_value,\n        ROUND(\n            AVG(total_revenue) OVER (),\n            2\n        ) AS overall_average_store_revenue\n    FROM store_performance\n)\n\nSELECT\n    store_id,\n    store_city,\n    province,\n    store_region,\n    total_transactions,\n    total_revenue,\n    overall_average_store_revenue,\n\n    ROUND(\n        total_revenue - overall_average_store_revenue,\n        2\n    ) AS revenue_deviation,\n\n    ROUND(\n        (\n            total_revenue - overall_average_store_revenue\n        ) * 100.0 / overall_average_store_revenue,\n        2\n    ) AS deviation_percent,\n\n    CASE\n        WHEN total_revenue > overall_average_store_revenue\n            THEN 'Above Average'\n        WHEN total_revenue < overall_average_store_revenue\n            THEN 'Below Average'\n        ELSE 'Average'\n    END AS performance_status\n\nFROM store_comparison\nORDER BY revenue_deviation DESC\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726175757_306a2272-8f74-49f6-8da2-eac5bc50c7cb\nINFO  : Total jobs = 3\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 3\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"store_id\tstore_city\tprovince\tstore_region\ttotal_transactions\ttotal_revenue\toverall_average_store_revenue\trevenue_deviation\tdeviation_percent\tperformance_status\nST-CAL-001\tCalgary\tAlberta\tWestern\t1167\t55573.77\t44977.58\t10596.19\t23.56\tAbove Average\nST-TOR-001\tToronto\tOntario\tCentral\t1302\t54080.88\t44977.58\t9103.30\t20.24\tAbove Average\nST-TOR-002\tToronto\tOntario\tCentral\t1151\t49425.30\t44977.58\t4447.72\t9.89\tAbove Average\nST-OTT-001\tOttawa\tOntario\tEastern\t1157\t48425.04\t44977.58\t3447.46\t7.66\tAbove Average\nST-MIS-001\tMississauga\tOntario\tCentral\t1154\t47075.34\t44977.58\t2097.76\t4.66\tAbove Average\nST-EDM-001\tEdmonton\tAlberta\tWestern\t1094\t46308.45\t44977.58\t1330.87\t2.96\tAbove Average\nST-BRA-001\tBrampton\tOntario\tCentral\t1004\t40625.77\t44977.58\t-4351.81\t-9.68\tBelow Average\nST-SCA-001\tScarborough\tOntario\tCentral\t949\t40277.22\t44977.58\t-4700.36\t-10.45\tBelow Average\nST-OTT-002\tOttawa\tOntario\tEastern\t940\t40078.66\t44977.58\t-4898.92\t-10.89\tBelow Average\nST-LON-001\tLondon\tOntario\tCentral\t947\t40069.41\t44977.58\t-4908.17\t-10.91\tBelow Average\nST-HAM-001\tHamilton\tOntario\tCentral\t939\t39916.22\t44977.58\t-5061.36\t-11.25\tBelow Average\nST-KIT-001\tKitchener\tOntario\tCentral\t921\t37874.89\t44977.58\t-7102.69\t-15.79\tBelow Average\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785088656518_954125485","id":"paragraph_1785088656518_954125485","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:57:36+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T17:57:57+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T17:58:53+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n### Store Performance Deviation Interpretation\n\nStore **ST-CAL-001** recorded the largest positive revenue deviation.\n\nIts total revenue was approximately **$55,573.77**, which was **$10,596.19** above the overall store average. This represents approximately **23.56%** above average.\n\nStore **ST-KIT-001** recorded the largest negative revenue deviation and performed below the overall store average.\n\nThe comparison identifies stores that may require different management actions. High-performing stores can be studied for successful operating practices, while below-average stores may require further investigation into customer traffic, product availability, staffing, pricing, or local market conditions.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T18:05:50+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Store Performance Deviation Interpretation</h3>\n<p>Store <strong>ST-CAL-001</strong> recorded the largest positive revenue deviation.</p>\n<p>Its total revenue was approximately <strong>$55,573.77</strong>, which was <strong>$10,596.19</strong> above the overall store average. This represents approximately <strong>23.56%</strong> above average.</p>\n<p>Store <strong>ST-KIT-001</strong> recorded the largest negative revenue deviation and performed below the overall store average.</p>\n<p>The comparison identifies stores that may require different management actions. High-performing stores can be studied for successful operating practices, while below-average stores may require further investigation into customer traffic, product availability, staffing, pricing, or local market conditions.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785088677052_172599641","id":"paragraph_1785088677052_172599641","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T17:57:57+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T18:05:50+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T18:05:50+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nWITH store_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,\n        ROUND(SUM(transaction_value), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(transaction_value), 2) AS average_transaction_value\n    FROM transaction_summary\n    GROUP BY\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region\n)\n\nSELECT\n    store_region,\n    store_id,\n    store_city,\n    total_transactions,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_transaction_value,\n\n    RANK() OVER (\n        PARTITION BY store_region\n        ORDER BY total_revenue DESC\n    ) AS regional_revenue_rank\n\nFROM store_performance\nORDER BY\n    store_region,\n    regional_revenue_rank;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T18:00:34+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726180034_377735c0-4142-46bf-876d-29aae95da9a7): \n\nWITH store_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,\n        ROUND(SUM(transaction_value), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(transaction_value), 2) AS average_transaction_value\n    FROM transaction_summary\n    GROUP BY\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region\n)\n\nSELECT\n    store_region,\n    store_id,\n    store_city,\n    total_transactions,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_transaction_value,\n\n    RANK() OVER (\n        PARTITION BY store_region\n        ORDER BY total_revenue DESC\n    ) AS regional_revenue_rank\n\nFROM store_performance\nORDER BY\n    store_region,\n    regional_revenue_rank\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: transaction_id, store_id, payment_type, store_city, loyalty_flag, quantity, province, final_price, product_id, event_timestamp, store_region\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:store_region, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:store_id, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:store_city, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_transactions, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_revenue, type:decimal(30,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:average_transaction_value, type:decimal(21,2), comment:null), FieldSchema(name:regional_revenue_rank, type:int, comment:null)], properties:null)\nINFO  : Completed compiling command(queryId=root_20260726180034_377735c0-4142-46bf-876d-29aae95da9a7); Time taken: 0.139 seconds\nINFO  : Concurrency mode is disabled, not creating a lock manager\nINFO  : Executing command(queryId=root_20260726180034_377735c0-4142-46bf-876d-29aae95da9a7): \n\nWITH store_performance AS (\n    SELECT\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region,\n        COUNT(*) AS total_transactions,\n        ROUND(SUM(transaction_value), 2) AS total_revenue,\n        ROUND(AVG(transaction_value), 2) AS average_transaction_value\n    FROM transaction_summary\n    GROUP BY\n        store_id,\n        store_city,\n        province,\n        store_region\n)\n\nSELECT\n    store_region,\n    store_id,\n    store_city,\n    total_transactions,\n    total_revenue,\n    average_transaction_value,\n\n    RANK() OVER (\n        PARTITION BY store_region\n        ORDER BY total_revenue DESC\n    ) AS regional_revenue_rank\n\nFROM store_performance\nORDER BY\n    store_region,\n    regional_revenue_rank\nWARN  : Hive-on-MR is deprecated in Hive 2 and may not be available in the future versions. Consider using a different execution engine (i.e. tez) or using Hive 1.X releases.\nINFO  : Query ID = root_20260726180034_377735c0-4142-46bf-876d-29aae95da9a7\nINFO  : Total jobs = 3\nINFO  : Launching Job 1 out of 3\nINFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:MAPRED] in serial mode\nINFO  : Number of reduce tasks not specified. Estimated from input data size: 1\nINFO  : In order to change the average load for a reducer (in bytes):\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=<number>\nINFO  : In order to limit the maximum number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set hive.exec.reducers.max=<number>\nINFO  : In order to set a constant number of reducers:\nINFO  :   set mapreduce.job.reduces=<number>\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"store_region\tstore_id\tstore_city\ttotal_transactions\ttotal_revenue\taverage_transaction_value\tregional_revenue_rank\nCentral\tST-TOR-001\tToronto\t1302\t54080.88\t41.54\t1\nCentral\tST-TOR-002\tToronto\t1151\t49425.30\t42.94\t2\nCentral\tST-MIS-001\tMississauga\t1154\t47075.34\t40.79\t3\nCentral\tST-BRA-001\tBrampton\t1004\t40625.77\t40.46\t4\nCentral\tST-SCA-001\tScarborough\t949\t40277.22\t42.44\t5\nCentral\tST-LON-001\tLondon\t947\t40069.41\t42.31\t6\nCentral\tST-HAM-001\tHamilton\t939\t39916.22\t42.51\t7\nCentral\tST-KIT-001\tKitchener\t921\t37874.89\t41.12\t8\nEastern\tST-OTT-001\tOttawa\t1157\t48425.04\t41.85\t1\nEastern\tST-OTT-002\tOttawa\t940\t40078.66\t42.64\t2\nWestern\tST-CAL-001\tCalgary\t1167\t55573.77\t47.62\t1\nWestern\tST-EDM-001\tEdmonton\t1094\t46308.45\t42.33\t2\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785088824461_1593004599","id":"paragraph_1785088824461_1593004599","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T18:00:24+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T18:00:34+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T18:01:31+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n### Regional Store Ranking\n\nThe regional ranking uses `RANK()` with `PARTITION BY store_region`.\n\nEach region receives its own independent store ranking, so a rank of **1** identifies the highest-revenue store within that specific region.\n\nThis result helps compare store performance within similar regional market conditions rather than comparing every store only at the national level.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T18:02:15+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Regional Store Ranking</h3>\n<p>The regional ranking uses <code>RANK()</code> with <code>PARTITION BY store_region</code>.</p>\n<p>Each region receives its own independent store ranking, so a rank of <strong>1</strong> identifies the highest-revenue store within that specific region.</p>\n<p>This result helps compare store performance within similar regional market conditions rather than comparing every store only at the national level.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785088834707_1024296497","id":"paragraph_1785088834707_1024296497","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T18:00:34+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T18:02:15+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T18:02:15+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n# Master Task 9 — Advanced Hive Analytics Summary\n\n## Completed Analysis\n\nThis section extended the core retail analysis through typed analytical views, transaction-level aggregation, time-based analysis, regional comparisons, promotion analysis, and Hive window functions.\n\nThe completed analyses include:\n\n1. Typed Hive analytical view\n2. Transaction-level summary\n3. Overall transaction metrics\n4. Transaction performance by store\n5. Regional revenue performance\n6. Average revenue per store by region\n7. Regional revenue ranking\n8. Hourly transaction activity\n9. Day-of-week transaction activity\n10. Category revenue contribution\n11. Category revenue ranking\n12. Promotion performance by category\n13. Promotional contribution within each category\n14. Promotional category ranking\n15. Store revenue ranking\n16. Store performance deviation\n17. Store ranking within each region\n\n## Advanced HiveQL Techniques\n\nThe analysis demonstrates the use of:\n\n- Common table expressions using `WITH`\n- Aggregate functions\n- Conditional aggregation using `CASE`\n- Timestamp functions\n- Transaction-level grouping\n- `RANK()` window functions\n- `SUM() OVER()` window functions\n- `AVG() OVER()` window functions\n- `PARTITION BY` for category and regional comparisons\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- Store **ST-CAL-001** in Calgary generated the highest store revenue at approximately **$55,573.77**.\n- The same store performed approximately **23.56% above** the overall average store revenue.\n- Store **ST-KIT-001** recorded the largest negative revenue deviation and performed approximately **15.79% below** the store average.\n- The **Central** region generated the highest total regional revenue.\n- The **Western** region recorded the highest average revenue per store at approximately **$50,941.11**.\n- The busiest transaction hour was **18:00**, with **1,809 transactions**.\n- **Sunday** recorded the highest transaction count, with **2,106 transactions**.\n- **Saturday** generated the highest day-level revenue.\n- **Grocery** generated the highest promotional revenue at approximately **$3,962.47**.\n- Promotional revenue represented only approximately **2.31%** of Grocery's total category revenue, indicating that Grocery performance was driven mainly by regular-priced sales.\n\n## Business Implications\n\nManagement should use both total performance and normalized performance measures when making decisions.\n\nTotal revenue identifies the largest overall contributors, while average revenue per store and revenue deviation provide fairer comparisons between locations and regions.\n\nPeak-hour and day-of-week findings can support staffing, checkout capacity, and inventory planning. Promotion results indicate that promotional sales represent a relatively small portion of category revenue, so future campaigns should be evaluated carefully against discount costs and additional sales volume.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T18:14:35+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Master Task 9 — Advanced Hive Analytics Summary</h1>\n<h2>Completed Analysis</h2>\n<p>This section extended the core retail analysis through typed analytical views, transaction-level aggregation, time-based analysis, regional comparisons, promotion analysis, and Hive window functions.</p>\n<p>The completed analyses include:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Typed Hive analytical view</li>\n<li>Transaction-level summary</li>\n<li>Overall transaction metrics</li>\n<li>Transaction performance by store</li>\n<li>Regional revenue performance</li>\n<li>Average revenue per store by region</li>\n<li>Regional revenue ranking</li>\n<li>Hourly transaction activity</li>\n<li>Day-of-week transaction activity</li>\n<li>Category revenue contribution</li>\n<li>Category revenue ranking</li>\n<li>Promotion performance by category</li>\n<li>Promotional contribution within each category</li>\n<li>Promotional category ranking</li>\n<li>Store revenue ranking</li>\n<li>Store performance deviation</li>\n<li>Store ranking within each region</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Advanced HiveQL Techniques</h2>\n<p>The analysis demonstrates the use of:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Common table expressions using <code>WITH</code></li>\n<li>Aggregate functions</li>\n<li>Conditional aggregation using <code>CASE</code></li>\n<li>Timestamp functions</li>\n<li>Transaction-level grouping</li>\n<li><code>RANK()</code> window functions</li>\n<li><code>SUM() OVER()</code> window functions</li>\n<li><code>AVG() OVER()</code> window functions</li>\n<li><code>PARTITION BY</code> for category and regional comparisons</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Key Findings</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Store <strong>ST-CAL-001</strong> in Calgary generated the highest store revenue at approximately <strong>$55,573.77</strong>.</li>\n<li>The same store performed approximately <strong>23.56% above</strong> the overall average store revenue.</li>\n<li>Store <strong>ST-KIT-001</strong> recorded the largest negative revenue deviation and performed approximately <strong>15.79% below</strong> the store average.</li>\n<li>The <strong>Central</strong> region generated the highest total regional revenue.</li>\n<li>The <strong>Western</strong> region recorded the highest average revenue per store at approximately <strong>$50,941.11</strong>.</li>\n<li>The busiest transaction hour was <strong>18:00</strong>, with <strong>1,809 transactions</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Sunday</strong> recorded the highest transaction count, with <strong>2,106 transactions</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Saturday</strong> generated the highest day-level revenue.</li>\n<li><strong>Grocery</strong> generated the highest promotional revenue at approximately <strong>$3,962.47</strong>.</li>\n<li>Promotional revenue represented only approximately <strong>2.31%</strong> of Grocery&rsquo;s total category revenue, indicating that Grocery performance was driven mainly by regular-priced sales.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Business Implications</h2>\n<p>Management should use both total performance and normalized performance measures when making decisions.</p>\n<p>Total revenue identifies the largest overall contributors, while average revenue per store and revenue deviation provide fairer comparisons between locations and regions.</p>\n<p>Peak-hour and day-of-week findings can support staffing, checkout capacity, and inventory planning. Promotion results indicate that promotional sales represent a relatively small portion of category revenue, so future campaigns should be evaluated carefully against discount costs and additional sales volume.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785088935822_152256780","id":"paragraph_1785088935822_152256780","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T18:02:15+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T18:14:35+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T18:14:35+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nSELECT\n    (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM retail_events_analytics)\n        AS total_events,\n\n    (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM transaction_summary)\n        AS total_transactions,\n\n    (SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT store_id) FROM transaction_summary)\n        AS total_stores,\n\n    (SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT category) FROM retail_events_analytics)\n        AS total_categories;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T18:14:49+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726181449_40780bec-5608-4002-8880-d2f49872f41d): \n\nSELECT\n    (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM retail_events_analytics)\n        AS total_events,\n\n    (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM transaction_summary)\n        AS total_transactions,\n\n    (SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT store_id) FROM transaction_summary)\n        AS total_stores,\n\n    (SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT category) FROM retail_events_analytics)\n        AS total_categories\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: transaction_id, store_id, payment_type, store_city, loyalty_flag, quantity, province, final_price, product_id, event_timestamp, store_region\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Co