l views remain consistent with the original dataset.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The event-level analytical view contains <strong>38,143 retail events</strong>.</li>\n<li>The transaction-level view contains <strong>12,725 distinct transactions</strong>.</li>\n<li>No temporary integration-test records remain in the dataset.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These validation results confirm that the advanced Hive analysis was performed on the complete and correctly integrated HBase dataset.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785089689786_1166777662","id":"paragraph_1785089689786_1166777662","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T18:14:49+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T18:18:46+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T18:18:46+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n\n# Master Task 10 — Python Statistical Analytics\n\n## Objective\n\nThis section uses Python to perform statistical analysis on transaction-level retail data created in Hive.\n\nThe analysis focuses on:\n\n- Transaction value distribution\n- Descriptive statistics\n- Central tendency\n- Data variability\n- Potential high-value transaction outliers\n\nThe Python results complement the HiveQL analysis by providing a clearer statistical view of customer spending behavior.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T18:21:15+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Master Task 10 — Python Statistical Analytics</h1>\n<h2>Objective</h2>\n<p>This section uses Python to perform statistical analysis on transaction-level retail data created in Hive.</p>\n<p>The analysis focuses on:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Transaction value distribution</li>\n<li>Descriptive statistics</li>\n<li>Central tendency</li>\n<li>Data variability</li>\n<li>Potential high-value transaction outliers</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Python results complement the HiveQL analysis by providing a clearer statistical view of customer spending behavior.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1785089926240_292913557","id":"paragraph_1785089926240_292913557","dateCreated":"2026-07-26T18:18:46+0000","dateStarted":"2026-07-26T18:21:15+0000","dateFinished":"2026-07-26T18:21:15+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%jdbc(hive)\n\nSELECT\n    transaction_id,\n    store_id,\n    store_region,\n    loyalty_flag,\n    payment_type,\n    total_quantity,\n    distinct_products,\n    transaction_value\nFROM transaction_summary;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-07-26T18:21:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"INFO  : Compiling command(queryId=root_20260726182143_171c9131-a95f-4b0b-b5b4-789883294c61): \n\nSELECT\n    transaction_id,\n    store_id,\n    store_region,\n    loyalty_flag,\n    payment_type,\n    total_quantity,\n    distinct_products,\n    transaction_value\nFROM transaction_summary\nINFO  : No Stats for default@retail_events_hive, Columns: transaction_id, store_id, payment_type, store_city, loyalty_flag, quantity, province, final_price, product_id, event_timestamp, store_region\nINFO  : Semantic Analysis Completed (retrial = false)\nINFO  : Created Hive schema: Schema(fieldSchemas:[FieldSchema(name:transaction_id, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:store_id, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:store_region, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:loyalty_flag, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:payment_type, type:string, comment:null), FieldSchema(name:total_quantity, type:bigint, comment:null), FieldSchema